        "original_id": "83070054-79d7-5a19-b098-eca9f3a83717",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Martin Freeman, Peter Jackson, Corey Johnson, Velibor Topic, Danny Dyer\n- Works: The Office, Sherlock, The Hobbit film trilogy, Fargo, The All Together\n- Roles: Tim Canterbury, Dr. John Watson, Bilbo Baggins, Lester Nygaard\n- Topics: Acting, British television, Film\n\nFacts:\n- Martin Freeman was born on 8 September 1971 and is an English actor.\n- The Office is a British mockumentary sitcom that was first broadcast in the United Kingdom on BBC Two on 9 July 2001.\n- Martin Freeman became known for portraying Tim Canterbury in the original UK version of The Office.\n- Martin Freeman became known for portraying Dr. John Watson in the British crime drama Sherlock.\n- Martin Freeman became known for portraying Bilbo Baggins in Peter Jackson's The Hobbit film trilogy.\n- Martin Freeman became known for portraying Lester Nygaard in the dark comedy-crime drama television series Fargo.\n- The All Together is a 2007 comedy feature film starring Martin Freeman, Corey Johnson, Velibor Topic, and Danny Dyer.",
